# Eriette's Tempting Apple: "When this artifact enters, gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until
# end of turn" (CR 613.1b, 611.2a, 701.26a, 702.10). Bot2 casts Llanowar Elves on turn 2; on turn 5 Bot1 casts the Apple, and Bot2 responds to its trigger by
# tapping the Elves for mana (it has been Bot2's since the start of its turn 4). The Elves become Bot1's, untapped and hasty, attack Bot2 for 1 and, at the
# end of turn, go back to Bot2 (the attack tapped it; Bot2 untaps it on turn 6).

